    <string name="accessibility_description">TARGET reads the screen or taps, types and scrolls only when you ask (for example \"read the screen\", \"tap Send\", or sending a WhatsApp message after you say yes). It does nothing on its own and stores nothing. Screen text goes to TARGET chat only when you ask.</string>
