    <string name="wake_help">A small on-phone (offline) model (~5 MB) listens for \"Hey Target\" / \"Hello Target\" / \"Wake up Target\" and sleeps on \"Bye Target\" / \"So jao\" / \"Go to sleep\". You can say \"Hey Target, play music on YouTube\" in one breath (Android 13+). It downloads once from the official k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx release and is checked with a checksum. It pauses in battery saver or while another app uses the mic.</string>
