    <string name="exp_mic_title">Why the microphone?</string>
    <string name="exp_mic">To hear your commands. It only listens when you open TARGET (or turn on \"Hey Target\").</string>
    <string name="exp_contacts_title">Contacts, calls and SMS</string>
    <string name="exp_contacts">For commands like \"call mom\", TARGET looks up the name in your contacts and calls or texts only after you say yes. Contacts never leave the phone.</string>
    <string name="exp_calls_title">Incoming calls</string>
    <string name="exp_calls">When a call rings, TARGET says who is calling. Say \"answer\" or \"reject\" (then yes) to handle it. Needs phone state, call log (for the number) and answer-call permissions.</string>
    <string name="exp_accessibility_title">Screen access (Accessibility)</string>
    <string name="exp_accessibility">This lets TARGET read the screen, tap, type, scroll, go back/home, lock, take screenshots and press Send in WhatsApp, only when you ask. On the next screen choose \"TARGET screen helper\" and turn it on.</string>
    <string name="exp_notifications_title">Notification access</string>
    <string name="exp_notifications">TARGET reads notifications aloud when you ask (not OTPs unless you ask), replies after your yes, and can auto-reply if you turn that on. Allow TARGET on the next screen.</string>
    <string name="exp_dnd_title">Do Not Disturb access</string>
    <string name="exp_dnd">Android needs this access to switch silent mode and Do Not Disturb. Allow TARGET on the next screen.</string>
    <string name="exp_brightness_title">Brightness</string>
    <string name="exp_brightness">To change brightness TARGET needs permission to modify system settings. Allow it on the next screen.</string>
    <string name="exp_alarms_title">Exact reminders</string>
    <string name="exp_alarms">Exact alarm permission makes reminders fire on the minute. Without it they may be a little late.</string>
    <string name="exp_wake_title">\"Hey Target\" wake word</string>
    <string name="exp_wake">A small model (~17 MB download, ~5 MB on the phone) comes from the official k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx release. TARGET then listens for \"Hey Target\" on the phone, offline, with a notification always shown. No audio is sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="app_lock">App lock (fingerprint / screen lock)</string>
    <string name="app_lock_help">When on, TARGET asks for fingerprint, face or screen lock before showing your chats and settings. Coming back within 1 minute does not ask again. Your phone needs a screen lock.</string>
